### Global roles available to authenticated users
GET {{host}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Request a global role; administrators review it
POST {{host}}/api/roles/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"role":"ADMIN"}

### My role requests
GET {{host}}/api/roles/requests/mine?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel my pending request
PATCH {{host}}/api/roles/requests/{{role_request_id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Administrator: list and decide global requests
GET {{host}}/api/roles/requests?page=0&size=10&status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###
PATCH {{host}}/api/roles/requests/{{role_request_id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###
PATCH {{host}}/api/roles/requests/{{role_request_id}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Administrator: replace global roles; at least one must remain.
### expectedRoles must match the roles fetched before editing or the update is rejected.
PUT {{host}}/api/roles/users/{{user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"roles":["USER","ADMIN"],"expectedRoles":["USER"]}

### Existing member requests OWNER on one tracker
POST {{host}}/api/expense-trackers/{{tracker_id}}/access-requests/owner
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Administrator or tracker owner: paged members
GET {{host}}/api/roles/trackers/{{tracker_id}}/members?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{owner_token}}

### Administrator or tracker owner: replace a member's tracker roles
PUT {{host}}/api/roles/trackers/{{tracker_id}}/users/{{user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{owner_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"roles":["EXPENSETRACKER_MEMBER","EXPENSETRACKER_OWNER"],"expectedRoles":["EXPENSETRACKER_MEMBER"]}

### Role notifications visible to the current account
GET {{host}}/api/roles/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
